  "description": "Young-woo is on the verge of leaving his company after completing his final mission to eliminate a drug dealer.\n\nJust as he is about to board a smuggling ship to China, he hears the news of his mother's death, who he lost contact with 20 years ago. There, he discovers he has a half-sister with the same name, Young-woo!\n\nMeanwhile, the organization, realizing Young-woo is still alive, tries to eliminate him and find his sister...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61182387), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%8C/3995)",
